- Bullet item introducing a directive

  ```{note}
  A directive fence inside a bullet list.
  ```

- Another bullet with a colon directive

  :::{tip}
  A colon directive inside a bullet list.
  :::

1. Numbered item introducing a directive

   ```{note}
   A directive fence inside a numbered list.
   ```

2. Numbered item with a plain fenced code block

   ```python
   x = 1
   ```

> A blockquote introducing a directive
>
> ```{note}
> Fence sharing the line with the > marker: this is the documented
> limitation — the marker is consumed before firstNonSpace rules can
> fire, so the fence renders unstyled (not a directive).
> ```

> Regular blockquote (not an alert).

